        "original_id": "f8a65b9f-2268-595a-80e9-62e9e12e7196",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Min-ho, Jun Ji-hyun\n- Films: Gangnam Blues, Bounty Hunters\n- Television series: The Legend of the Blue Sea\n- Places: Seoul, Gangnam district\n- Topics: real estate development, socio-political turmoil, terrorism\n\nFacts:\n- Gangnam Blues is set in the 1970s in Seoul's Gangnam district during real estate development amid socio-political turmoil and terrorism.\n- In 2015, Lee Min-ho starred in his first leading film role in Gangnam Blues.\n- In 2016, Lee Min-ho followed Gangnam Blues with his first China-produced film, Bounty Hunters.\n- The Legend of the Blue Sea is a 2016–2017 South Korean television series starring Jun Ji-hyun and Lee Min-ho.",
